              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So a report spread among the followers of Jesus that this disciple would not die. But Jesus did not say that he would not die; he said, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.23",
